{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061333/block/singleImage/3254240/df/01M68M2ZYYYQ4GXNWDGFAPMY28.jpg?updatedAt=1793438571\"/><figcaption>王嘉爾（Jackson Wang）原創暗黑奇幻IP品牌Under the Castle（UTC）搞作多多。</figcaption></figure><p>王嘉爾（Jackson Wang）原創暗黑奇幻IP品牌Under the Castle（UTC）搞作多多，繼與麥當勞合作後，今次更聯乘紫荊旗下維港地標紅磡新海濱，特別呈獻萬聖節限定無人機光影騷。UTC 核心角色胖奇（PUMPKIE）與小奇（SPOOKIE）首次以無人機形態飛越維多利亞港夜空，為 UTC 帶給香港的萬聖節氛圍推到高空。 今次光影騷以Under the Castle × 紅磡新海濱聯名跨界合作燃亮整個維港，動用超過2000架無人機點亮夜空。除吸引過萬市民到現場欣賞之外，香港多處亦驚喜看到，例如紅磡海底隧道入口，令市民驚喜萬分，同時標誌着UTC為期一個半月在香港的節日體驗圓滿結束</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.272152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.872661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:26.503822+00:00","content_hash":"35b393bedaa664a0f00a875b1becb2a43ae85aa02ca2e9f41209090585610f75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.272152+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}